        "SWP-018",
        "SWP-035",
        "SWP-036"
      ],
      "prompt": "A team reports repeated unsuccessful referrals after discharge for adults with chronic conditions. Design a reflective service-improvement response that examines access barriers and responsibilities while protecting confidentiality. Explain what evidence can and cannot show and how individual plans would remain supported.",
      "model_answer": "Use anonymised patterns alongside individual follow-up, distinguish referral activity from outcomes, clarify team roles and service capacity, include service-user participation, establish review measures and owners, and avoid causal or misconduct claims unsupported by local evidence. Include support for staff and organisational review rather than attributing every failure to individuals.",
